        {
            "citation":"The union of the Who's On First region records Abra (85676039), Apayao (85676053), Ifugao (85676077), Mountain Province (85676079), Banguet (85676111), Kalinga (85676269), Benguet (85676359). A province or city record is assigned to the region its Wikidata item is located in (P131), read on 2026-11-26, which covers 88 of the 103 records. The other 15 hold a wd:id that isn't the place's own item and are assigned to the region GeoNames files most of the populated places inside their boundary under. Bacolod follows Republic Act No. 12000 into the Negros Island Region.",
